vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sB1l5-BfVWAQ7kNvwFU1iEn&_nc_oc=Adl6Sxeo_GRW73xUKWk4m83e5zmRD0sJd5C1Ajo-s1cuiputHu4IlEdMzvpteyK2KZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwvAECKen-o0zkAodd0QMYgADAoE2KvsgH3jipFNe3ydw&oe=69BBF454"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jqz0pWcqjqgQ7kNvwESQalj&_nc_oc=AdkpMoVyHzLQA7ANJkx7sDJdhzWzRSUGB1FG46AxBdl5WjJKQ-D6QmQ615V0NkPE-I8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw-7iNstW4ISGJ3bFeCkGEDWdQau-1PgQuq0dn2N6D3Gw&oe=69BBF932"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NQEuSJ5HuYwQ7kNvwH-N9Ph&_nc_oc=AdnzlDvVzLhQfLWG6z9lcU3pp5p7GQV03pRkb9F_E3bW0BWTGYm_E8bR96o3lqjLmNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwnrDP2nXKJuQ6xB0FLCd4RG6sDMacAFdWrYbFXYyl0Tg&oe=69BC06D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "